# Package manager
# The lockfile IS committed. An application needs its dependency tree pinned: npm ci in CI
# cannot run without it, and a floating resolution makes a deploy differ from the build it was
# tested against. Only package manager specific caches stay ignored.
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml